{
  "statement": "The SafetyAgent emphasizes the critical need for safety and reliability in the RollCall system. SAF-01 ensures secure authentication, preventing unauthorized access to sensitive attendance data. SAF-02 provides real-time data synchronization, ensuring accurate attendance records across classes. SAF-03 implements alerts for discrepancies, promoting data accuracy. SAF-04 mandates historical data retention for long-term analysis while SAF-05 supports accountability through logging attendance modifications. SAF-06 allows manual overrides during failures, enhancing fault tolerance, and SAF-07 ensures continuous security audits to identify vulnerabilities. Together, these requirements establish a robust safety framework for the system.",
